Dialogue: 3,1:25:56.80,1:25:59.47,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ My silent little room is growing dim ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:03.66,1:26:06.10,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ And the man next door ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:06.10,1:26:10.24,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Is saying what a lousy day it's been ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:13.66,1:26:16.90,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ And the clock on the wall ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:23.63,1:26:25.63,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ In the room below ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:25.63,1:26:31.43,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ The girl's crying for her guy again ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:33.23,1:26:37.97,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ After the lights go out what will I do? ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:37.97,1:26:45.53,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ After the lights go out, facing the night without you ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:51.66,1:26:54.30,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ There's a pigeon that's ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:26:54.30,1:26:59.37,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Been sitting on my windowsill all day ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:00.83,1:27:03.40,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ I guess he's lonely too ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:03.40,1:27:08.93,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ I wonder if his love has flown away ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:10.50,1:27:13.00,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ When I get up on my feet ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:13.00,1:27:18.20,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ I need a cup of coffee anyway ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:20.04,1:27:22.16,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Someone called for you ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:22.16,1:27:24.76,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ But I hung up the phone ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:24.76,1:27:28.10,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ What could I say? ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:29.80,1:27:34.36,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ After the lights go out what will I do? ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:27:34.36,1:27:42.06,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ After the lights go out, facing the night without you ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:26.23,1:28:29.07,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ I don't look for her ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:29.07,1:28:34.66,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ I find her in the shadow of my mind ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:36.17,1:28:38.23,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ For she's just a girl ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:38.23,1:28:44.13,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Whose memory will be wiped away with time ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:45.66,1:28:47.40,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Any second now ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:47.40,1:28:53.13,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ The lamp down the street will show it's light ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:54.83,1:28:57.07,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ And I just can't seem ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:28:57.07,1:29:03.19,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ To tear away her kisses from the night ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:29:04.26,1:29:08.73,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ After the lights go out what will I do? ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:29:08.74,1:29:16.27,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ After the lights go out, facing the night without you ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:29:16.27,1:29:20.17,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Facing the night without you ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:29:20.17,1:29:25.16,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Facing the night without you ∮
Dialogue: 3,1:29:25.17,1:29:30.13,LRC,,0,0,0,,∮ Facing the night without you ∮
Dialogue: 4,0:01:38.43,0:01:44.42,注释,,0,0,0,,混沌是未解读的秩序
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.66,0:19:07.56,注释,,0,0,0,,弗雷泽·阿什
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.57,0:19:11.55,注释,,0,0,0,,男侍甲:弗雷泽·阿什 男侍乙:凯文·克里斯特 男侍丙:丹尼尔·圣克莱尔
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.55,0:19:26.54,注释,,0,0,0,,弗雷泽·阿什
Dialogue: 4,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.53,注释,,0,0,0,,凯文·克里斯特
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.52,0:19:58.51,注释,,0,0,0,,伏尔加人才经纪公司 丹尼尔·圣克莱尔
Dialogue: 4,0:20:08.51,0:20:13.79,注释,,0,0,0,,丹尼尔·圣克莱尔 身高:183cm 体重:72kg 眼睛颜色:蓝色
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.80,注释,,0,0,0,,出演电影《有志者事竟成》2005年 饰 男侍丙
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.80,注释,,0,0,0,,《稍后回我》2003年 饰 华特
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.80,注释,,0,0,0,,《无票旅客》2000年 饰 火车上的男人
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.21,0:21:49.11,注释,,0,0,0,,来电 妈妈
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.80,0:21:57.70,注释,,0,0,0,,联系我们
Dialogue: 4,0:22:03.89,0:22:07.79,注释,,0,0,0,,安大略省多伦多市卡拉汉莱恩套房74幢901室 伏尔加人才经纪公司
Dialogue: 4,0:25:41.10,0:25:42.60,注释,,0,0,0,,丹尼尔·圣克莱尔
Dialogue: 4,0:26:01.38,0:26:07.58,注释,,0,0,0,,个人机密档案
Dialogue: 4,0:26:07.78,0:26:12.57,注释,,0,0,0,,安东尼·克莱尔 安大略省密西莎加市拉斯本路3650号
Dialogue: 4,0:35:21.93,0:35:23.83,注释,,0,0,0,,来电号码未显示
Dialogue: 4,0:35:36.92,0:35:41.31,注释,,0,0,0,,亚当·贝尔 历史老师
Dialogue: 4,0:35:59.90,0:36:05.29,注释,,0,0,0,,UGT大学教员名录 亚当·贝尔 副教授
Dialogue: 4,0:38:05.97,0:38:11.46,注释,,0,0,0,,来电 安东尼·克莱尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 吾儿 是妈妈我啊\N{\rENG}Hello, darling. It's your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:18.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴你让我参观你那新房子\N{\rENG}Thank you for showing me your new apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:18.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很担心你…\N{\rENG}I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 你怎么能这样过生活\N{\rENG}I mean, how can you live like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.07,0:01:28.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你会给我回电话吧？\N{\rENG}Anyway, would you call me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们再见见面吧\N{\rENG}Let's get together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:32.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\rENG}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:06.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,控制\N{\rENG}Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,控制至上\N{\rENG}It's all about control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:13.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一个独裁政权都会有一种强迫症\N{\rENG}Every dictatorship has one obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是控制欲\N{\rENG}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,比如 在古罗马\N{\rENG}So, in ancient Rome,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,统治者们使民众只满足于面包和马戏\N{\rENG}they gave the people bread and circuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:25.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,而草民不断被强迫斗兽 以供统治者们赏玩取乐\N{\rENG}They kept the populace busy with entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:31.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,但别具用心的独裁政权 会使用另外的策略…\N{\rENG}But other dictatorships use other strategies to control ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:33.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,企图控制民众的认知\N{\rENG}The knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,如何实行这种控制？\N{\rENG}How do they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:38.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,通过愚民教育\N{\rENG}Lower education.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,限制文化传播\N{\rENG}They limit culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,加强信息审查\N{\rENG}Censor information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:48.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们审核限制任何形式的个性诉求\N{\rENG}They censor any means of individual expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:52.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,这点很重要 大家要记住 纵观整个历史\N{\rENG}And it's important to remember this, that this is a pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:55.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是一种不断重演的模式\N{\rENG}that repeats itself throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:05:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:02.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,下周见\N{\rENG}See you next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:11.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\rENG}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\rENG}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不赖\N{\rENG}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:03.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 每个独裁政权\N{\rENG}See, every dictatorship,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,都有种强迫症 妄想控制所有\N{\rENG}there's only one obsession and that's control,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:09.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,企图去掌控所有的民众\N{\rENG}they want to have control over the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:14.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,在古罗马 统治者们使民众只满足于面包和马戏\N{\rENG}In ancient Rome, they gave bread and circuses,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:18.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,而平民却不断被强迫斗兽 以统治者们赏玩取乐\N{\rENG}they kept the populace busy with entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:23.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,但别具用心的独裁政权 会使用另外的策略\N{\rENG}In other dictatorships, they have other strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:29.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,限制信息传播 以禁锢民众的思想和认知\N{\rENG}To limit information, to limit ideas and knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,如何实行这种控制？\N{\rENG}How do they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:36.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,通过愚民教育 限制文化交流\N{\rENG}They lower education, limit culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:41.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,严禁任何形式的个性诉求\N{\rENG}They censor any means of self-expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这点很重要 请记住 这是一种不断重演的模式\N{\rENG}But it's important to remember this, this is a pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:48.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,纵观整个…\N{\rENG}that repeats itself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:50.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,历史进程\N{\rENG}throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你平时不会去看电影 是吗？\N{\rENG}You don't go to the movies, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:20.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,电影？\N{\rENG}Movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯哼 你是电影爱好者吗？\N{\rENG}Yeah, are you a movie guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 空余时间\N{\rENG}In your free time, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 没有 我不是…\N{\rENG}I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:34.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不怎么去电影院 我根本就不喜欢电影\N{\rENG}I don't go out that much, I don't really like movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:36.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\rENG}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:42.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不一定要外出看了 在家也能看部好片\N{\rENG}You don't have to go out to enjoy a good flick at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:43.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\rENG}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:48.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我通常会租碟看片\N{\rENG}I usually just rent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,而现在的人却不喜欢\N{\rENG}Most people don't these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我享受看碟的乐趣\N{\rENG}but it's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:54.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你问我这个 你是不是有什么要说？\N{\rENG}Is there a reason why you're asking me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有啊\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你突然跟我提起电影 我以为…\N{\rENG}'Cause you brought it up and I thought, you know, maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会有什么好的推荐 或者你有又想看又喜欢的电影\N{\rENG}you had a recommendation, or you saw a movie that you liked
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:02.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我谈这 又或者…\N{\rENG}and you want to tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.55,0:10:06.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 当然 有些事情总得有个理由\N{\rENG}Oh, sure, I mean, there's always something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我应该追求些更积极的东西 - 嗯\N{\rENG}- I could go for something cheerful. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:25.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,"有志者 事竟成"\N{\rENG}Where There's a Will There's a Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:26.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的对\N{\rENG}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:30.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 那是部电影的名字 这片我刚看完 不过…\N{\rENG}No, it's a movie, I saw it a little while ago, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:34.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得 我挺喜欢这片的\N{\rENG}I remember, I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:36.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯… 《有志者 事竟成》\N{\rENG}Hmm. Where There's a Will There's a Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:37.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 就叫这名\N{\rENG}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:39.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,本土制作 如果你…\N{\rENG}Local film, if you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会记住的\N{\rENG}I'll keep it in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:26.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我似乎有点醉了\N{\rENG}I think I'm drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,陪我去睡吧\N{\rENG}You wanna go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:33.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\rENG}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要进去睡觉吧？\N{\rENG}You wanna go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我得先把这些试卷批改完\N{\rENG}No, I'm gonna finish grading these papers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:41.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后 再来陪你 好吗？\N{\rENG}and then I'll come join you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,安德逊先生 我丈夫就要回来了…\N{\rENG}Mr. Henderson, my husband will be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:36.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你丈夫刚赢了我很多钱\N{\rENG}Your husband just won a heck lot of money from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,看他的眼神我知道 他现在还不想离开\N{\rENG}By the look in his eye he didn't have an intention to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,哎哟\N{\rENG}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:47.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\rENG}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:48.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\rENG}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:51.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\rENG}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rENG}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天我会联系你\N{\rENG}I'll call you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 我迟到了\N{\rENG}Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\rENG}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:52.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,开始上课\N{\rENG}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:55.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,上一节课我们讨论了独裁政权\N{\rENG}Last class we talked about dictatorship,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么今天 我们来讲黑格尔\N{\rENG}so today we'll start with Hegel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,黑格尔有句名言\N{\rENG}It was Hegel who said that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:06.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,"一切伟大的世界历史事件都会出现两次"\N{\rENG}all the greatest world events happen twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后 卡尔·马克思对此补充到\N{\rENG}And then, Karl Marx added, the first time it was a tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,"第一次是个悲剧 第二次则是一场闹剧"\N{\rENG}and the second time it was a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,有种奇怪的说法…\N{\rENG}It's strange to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,当今世界上很多思想家都担忧…\N{\rENG}A lot of the world's thinkers are worried
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:24.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,本世纪将重蹈上一世纪的覆辙\N{\rENG}that this century will be a repetition of the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:30.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有一种有趣的言论 是关于回忆的创造性说法\N{\rENG}And there's an interesting observation, a creative act of memory
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你所记住的东西 所记住的人…\N{\rENG}to remember something, to remember somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想找两部片 《稍后覆我》和《无票旅客》\N{\rENG}I'm looking for Call me L8R or Passenger Without a Ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\rENG}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:15.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,安东尼？\N{\rENG}Anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:17.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,安东尼\N{\rENG}Anthony!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.34,0:24:21.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\rENG}Hey, long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:24.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,蓄了大胡子都认不出你了 为了拍电影蓄的？\N{\rENG}I couldn't tell it was you with that beard. Is that for a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.61,0:24:25.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:28.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你都很久没来这儿了\N{\rENG}Man, you haven't been around here for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.29,0:24:30.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不知道多久了\N{\rENG}Yeah, I don't know how long it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,大概有半年了吧\N{\rENG}Six months, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:34.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,半年可能还不止\N{\rENG}Six months or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:37.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 你最近还好吗？\N{\rENG}Yeah, so how's everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:39.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\rENG}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:43.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你约了人回来这里吗？可这里一个人都没有哦\N{\rENG}Are you meeting someone here? 'Cause there's no one around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.43,0:24:44.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没人？没\N{\rENG}- No? - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.55,0:24:47.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,周六没人来上班的啊\N{\rENG}you know no one comes in on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:49.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\rENG}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.47,0:24:53.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来想拿些资料 一些…\N{\rENG}I was supposed to pick up the thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.06,0:24:57.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,拍电影要用的…\N{\rENG}For the movie. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:59.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我忘了今天是周六… 我这脑袋啊…\N{\rENG}And I forgot it was Saturday... 'Cause my head is, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.74,0:25:02.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们演员都是大忙人\N{\rENG}You actors are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.45,0:25:04.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你等等 我看看这儿有没有你要的东西\N{\rENG}Hold on, let me see if there's anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.01,0:25:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.61,0:25:12.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有的 有了 你看\N{\rENG}Yeah, here it is, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.56,0:25:15.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 看起来有点像 就是这个了 肯定是这个\N{\rENG}Oh, that looks like it's it. That's definitely it. That's definitely it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.96,0:25:17.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那你拿好 没错吧？- 没错\N{\rENG}- There you go. All right? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:19.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 以后常来 - 会来的\N{\rENG}- Hey, don't be a stranger. - I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你拍戏顺利\N{\rENG}Good luck with that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.27,0:25:22.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 额… 谢谢\N{\rENG}Great, I will... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.91,0:27:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,安东尼·克莱尔\N{\rENG}Anthony Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:34.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉斯本路3650号\N{\rENG}3650 Rathburn Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.30,0:28:58.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.74,0:29:01.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 下午好 我想找… - 嘿\N{\rENG}- Good afternoon, I'm calling... - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.77,0:29:03.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我打来想找…\N{\rENG}Um, I'm calling to speak to...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.73,0:29:05.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你从哪打来的？\N{\rENG}Where are you calling from?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.05,0:29:07.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我想你误会了\N{\rENG}I'm sorry, I think there's been a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.29,0:29:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我打来想找丹尼尔·圣克莱尔聊几句\N{\rENG}I'm calling to speak to Daniel Saint Claire, the...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.05,0:29:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,安东尼？\N{\rENG}Anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.52,0:29:13.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,安东尼 你打回家来了\N{\rENG}Anthony, you called home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.56,0:29:15.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我没明白\N{\rENG}I'm sorry, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:17.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛呢？\N{\rENG}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.84,0:29:18.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不叫安东尼\N{\rENG}My name's not Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是安东尼？\N{\rENG}You're not Anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.16,0:29:24.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是 我打来是想找那个叫丹尼尔·圣·克莱尔的演员\N{\rENG}No, I'm calling to speak to Daniel Saint Claire, the actor. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:28.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我没弄错的话 这应该是…\N{\rENG}If I'm not mistaken, that's Anthony Claire's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.47,0:29:31.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,艺名为安东尼·克莱尔\N{\rENG}name that he uses for the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.38,0:29:34.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个演员的家\N{\rENG}For his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.26,0:29:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rENG}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.58,0:29:39.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 但是丹尼尔现在不在\N{\rENG}Right, well, Daniel isn't here right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.66,0:29:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫他回来再打给你吧\N{\rENG}maybe I could get him to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.29,0:29:44.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 很抱歉打扰你了\N{\rENG}Okay, I'm sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:47.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rENG}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.09,0:29:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rENG}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:29:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 我…\N{\rENG}I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:02.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,请问你是谁？\N{\rENG}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.75,0:30:08.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂？你是谁啊？\N{\rENG}Hello? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.55,0:30:10.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不认识我的\N{\rENG}He doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:11.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.62,0:30:12.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的 我打算… - 安东尼？\N{\rENG}- Okay. I'm gonna... - Anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.74,0:30:14.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我迟点打给你\N{\rENG}I'll call back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.99,0:31:22.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.23,0:31:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 我是安东尼…\N{\rENG}Hello, this is Anthony...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.75,0:31:27.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,安东尼·克莱尔 是吧？\N{\rENG}This is Anthony Claire, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.03,0:31:28.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\rENG}Who's calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.90,0:31:31.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.02,0:31:36.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我之前有打来过 我和我和你太太说了几句 神经病\N{\rENG}I called before. I was talking... I talked to your wife. Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.06,0:31:37.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是那个\N{\rENG}You're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.74,0:31:39.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要是再打来 我就报警…\N{\rENG}And you call here again, I will call the police...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.42,0:31:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我… 别 别 听我说\N{\rENG}I... No, no. Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.21,0:31:46.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能不能再说点什么？多讲几句话\N{\rENG}Can you say something again? Can you talk again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.73,0:31:48.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你谁啊你？\N{\rENG}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.09,0:31:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这太神经了 太扯了\N{\rENG}That's crazy. That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.48,0:31:54.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你声音和我一样 你有没有听出我的声音来？\N{\rENG}Our... Your voice is just like mine. Do you hear my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.76,0:31:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们俩的声音居然一模一样…\N{\rENG}Your voice is just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.80,0:31:59.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\rENG}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.70,0:32:16.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听着… - 先别挂 拜托 拜托\N{\rENG}- Listen... - Sorry, please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.02,0:32:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听我说 就一会\N{\rENG}Just listen to me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.22,0:32:19.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,就一会 听我讲 好吗？\N{\rENG}Just listen, okay? Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.30,0:32:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你以为我疯了 很抱歉 我刚刚太激动了\N{\rENG}I know this sounds crazy. I'm sorry. I got excited before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.25,0:32:22.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我激动的时候 我就变得胡言乱语\N{\rENG}When I get excited, I just act a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.93,0:32:24.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,请再听我说几句\N{\rENG}So just hear me out for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.61,0:32:27.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看了三部你演的电影\N{\rENG}I've seen three of your movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.05,0:32:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你演… 你演得相当好 非常好\N{\rENG}And you're great in them. You're great in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们俩个长得实在是太像了\N{\rENG}We look exactly alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.72,0:32:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,早些时候我和你老婆谈过电话\N{\rENG}And I called your wife earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:38.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,她… 她把我当成你了\N{\rENG}And she said that... She thought that I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:41.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 我… 我很困惑\N{\rENG}And I'm just... I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.23,0:32:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我这通电话会让你和我一样感到困惑\N{\rENG}And I know this call must be just as confusing for you as it is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.03,0:32:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 我只是… 我叫亚当·贝尔 是一名大学讲师\N{\rENG}And I just... My name is Adam Bell. I'm a history teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.19,0:32:50.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们应该见个面\N{\rENG}And I just think that we should meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.38,0:32:58.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了 好的 没问题\N{\rENG}Hey, hey, hey, okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.26,0:33:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听着 别再打电话来了\N{\rENG}Listen to me. Never call here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.81,0:33:09.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁打来的？\N{\rENG}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.17,0:33:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是那家伙\N{\rENG}It was that same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.20,0:33:15.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,他想要什么吗？\N{\rENG}What did he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:16.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不认识的 他挺起来有点神经\N{\rENG}I don't know. He sounded crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.48,0:33:19.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,他… 他听起来像是追星族或者其他的\N{\rENG}Like, he sounded like a stalker or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:20.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,追星族？\N{\rENG}A stalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 他说他是我的影迷\N{\rENG}Yeah, he said that he was a fan of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.47,0:33:24.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我见面什么的 这就是他想要的吧\N{\rENG}That he wanted to, uh, meet up or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.51,0:33:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 见面？- 嗯\N{\rENG}- What? - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.43,0:33:30.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 是的\N{\rENG}- No. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:38.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在忽悠我吧\N{\rENG}You're messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.14,0:33:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\rENG}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.21,0:33:46.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安东尼 - 呃…\N{\rENG}- Anthony? - Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.61,0:33:49.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,想吃点东西吗？\N{\rENG}Do you want to get something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.24,0:33:53.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁打来的？\N{\rENG}Who was on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.36,0:33:58.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦 是之前打电话过来那人 还是那个人\N{\rENG}Helen, the same guy who called before. The same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:34:00.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他打来的\N{\rENG}That's who was on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.76,0:34:04.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说得很清楚了 为什么你还要深究那是谁呢？\N{\rENG}I told you that. Why would I tell you any differently?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:06.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在骗我吗？\N{\rENG}Are you lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.39,0:34:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rENG}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.74,0:34:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在骗我\N{\rENG}You're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.62,0:34:17.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你太神经质了\N{\rENG}You're acting crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.30,0:34:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才没有神经质 到底是谁打来的\N{\rENG}I'm not crazy. Who was on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.25,0:34:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都说了打电话来的是个男人\N{\rENG}I told you it was a man who was on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.29,0:34:30.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是不是打算和她见面？\N{\rENG}Are you seeing her?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.73,0:34:32.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦 我不想为这和你吵架\N{\rENG}Helen, I don't want to get into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.40,0:34:34.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你又要去和她见面？\N{\rENG}Are you seeing her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.24,0:34:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我得去吃点东西\N{\rENG}We need to get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:41.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱出去吃饭吧 然后…\N{\rENG}Let's go get something to eat and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.75,0:34:42.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都不想吃…\N{\rENG}I don't want to get anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.99,0:34:45.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是个男的 男的啊\N{\rENG}It was a man! It was a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.19,0:34:48.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我当什么人 出去偷腥的丈夫？\N{\rENG}What do you think it was, a jealous husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.87,0:34:50.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.66,0:34:54.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想跟你吵了 好吗？\N{\rENG}I don't want to get into this again. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.38,0:34:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想吵架\N{\rENG}I don't want to get into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.78,0:34:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去散散步\N{\rENG}I'm going for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.74,0:38:15.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\rENG}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.82,0:38:16.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂 是我 伙计\N{\rENG}Yeah, it's me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.90,0:38:19.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,这太神奇了 我有预感你要给我打电话\N{\rENG}That's so strange. I had a feeling that you were gonna call.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.98,0:38:22.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有预感？什么意思？\N{\rENG}You had a feeling, what's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.09,0:38:28.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是 用"预感"这词其实是一种比喻 不是…\N{\rENG}It's a, you know, just a figure of speech. It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 听着 我想着我俩的事\N{\rENG}Right. All right. Well, look, I've been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.73,0:38:31.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们见个面吧\N{\rENG}I want to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.56,0:38:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:37.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道有个地方 叫"屋顶酒店"\N{\rENG}I know a place called the Breezeway Inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.28,0:38:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,离市区大概一小时车程 你知道那地方吗？\N{\rENG}It's about an hour outside the city. Do you know where that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.35,0:38:42.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.75,0:38:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 周日我会打电话告诉你具体位置\N{\rENG}All right. Well, then I'll call you on Sunday with directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.59,0:38:47.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,下午一点 怎么样？\N{\rENG}1:00, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.43,0:38:48.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.51,0:38:50.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\rENG}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.07,0:38:51.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rENG}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.18,0:38:54.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那 到时候见 - 好的\N{\rENG}- Well, see you soon. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.58,0:38:57.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,那… 到时候见吧\N{\rENG}Yeah, I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.90,0:40:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rENG}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.37,0:40:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rENG}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.41,0:40:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\rENG}Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你几个月了？\N{\rENG}How many months are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.43,0:40:47.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\rENG}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.39,0:40:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,六个月\N{\rENG}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.26,0:40:54.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,好幸福\N{\rENG}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.81,0:41:11.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得走了 还有一节课要教\N{\rENG}I should be going. I have a class, I have to teach in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.39,0:41:23.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,好…\N{\rENG}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.07,0:41:28.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你永远不会知道日子会变成怎么\N{\rENG}Never know how your day is gonna turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.67,0:41:30.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你愉快\N{\rENG}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:53.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么事 亲爱的\N{\rENG}What's up, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.48,0:41:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.00,0:41:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.41,0:42:22.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rENG}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.97,0:42:30.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,外面真热啊\N{\rENG}It is a scorcher out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:33.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才跑到最后十分钟的时候\N{\rENG}The last 10 minutes of my run,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:36.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个大概22岁的小子 他就…\N{\rENG}this 22-year-old kid or something like that, he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.76,0:42:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直跟着我 跟在我后面跑\N{\rENG}He was following me the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.83,0:42:42.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我全程没碰过那小子\N{\rENG}Never gonna beat this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.39,0:42:44.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,而他自己摔倒了\N{\rENG}And he dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.95,0:42:48.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看到我剃掉胡子了吗？天气真是太热了\N{\rENG}Do you think that I should cut my beard off 'cause it's fucking hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.63,0:42:53.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,等下 你刚才打我电话干嘛？有事找我吗？\N{\rENG}Wait, why did you call me earlier? Did you call me for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.58,0:42:57.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝 蓝莓放在哪里了？\N{\rENG}Honey, where are the blueberries?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.58,0:43:02.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,蓝莓放哪了？\N{\rENG}Where are the blueberries?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.33,0:43:04.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我两天前跟你说过的\N{\rENG}I told you, like, two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.69,0:43:07.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,有机蓝莓 不是普通的那种\N{\rENG}The organic blueberries. Not the conventional blueberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能用普通那种来拍摄\N{\rENG}I can't use 'em in the shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.93,0:43:11.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rENG}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.56,0:43:13.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就过下嘴瘾 因为我读…\N{\rENG}I wasn't... Only I was saying 'cause I read it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.12,0:43:14.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,过一本杂志说 蓝莓…\N{\rENG}in a magazine that blueberries,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.44,0:43:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,有机那种比普通那种要好点…\N{\rENG}the organic ones are better than conventional ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.15,0:43:31.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我说说 发生什么事了\N{\rENG}Are you gonna tell me what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rENG}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.53,0:43:44.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我刚才…\N{\rENG}I went to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.33,0:43:50.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我刚才去见那个人了\N{\rENG}I went to see that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.72,0:43:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪个人？你在说什么？\N{\rENG}Who? What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.44,0:43:58.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,电话里那人\N{\rENG}The guy on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.76,0:44:00.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去了他上班的地方\N{\rENG}I went to his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.71,0:44:09.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么去啊？那很危险啊 宝贝\N{\rENG}Why did you do that? That's dangerous, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.03,0:44:10.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想搞清楚\N{\rENG}I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.58,0:44:20.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\rENG}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.77,0:44:25.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的声音和你的一样\N{\rENG}He had the same voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.73,0:44:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,长得也和你一模一样\N{\rENG}He looks exactly like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.92,0:44:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么意思 和我一模一样？\N{\rENG}What do you mean, "Exactly like me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.08,0:44:41.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？\N{\rENG}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.66,0:44:54.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我… 我真心不知道你在说什么\N{\rENG}I don't... Really don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.38,0:44:58.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你是知道的\N{\rENG}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.73,0:45:05.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是知道的\N{\rENG}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.84,0:47:58.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.71,0:49:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\rENG}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.42,0:51:02.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我看看你的手 - 为什么？\N{\rENG}- Show me your hands, man. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.57,0:51:06.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,快 伸出你的双手\N{\rENG}Come on, show me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.03,0:51:31.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们是兄弟\N{\rENG}Maybe we're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.98,0:51:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我们不是兄弟 不会是的\N{\rENG}We're not... We're not brothers. We're not brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.78,0:51:39.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道不是？\N{\rENG}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.73,0:51:43.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有\N{\rENG}Do you have a...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.53,0:51:47.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你胸口有没有一个疤？\N{\rENG}Do you have a scar on your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:57.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,像这样的\N{\rENG}This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.19,0:52:10.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也有 是不是\N{\rENG}You do, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.26,0:52:17.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rENG}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.66,0:52:20.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你生日是几号？- 这是次错误的会面\N{\rENG}- When's your birthday? - This was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.09,0:52:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我有些东西搞错了\N{\rENG}I think I made a mistake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.73,0:52:25.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:27.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得…\N{\rENG}I have a...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.77,0:52:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我拿了这个 我扮作是你\N{\rENG}I have this. I went to...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.09,0:52:30.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,上过去过你公司\N{\rENG}The company that represents you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.88,0:52:32.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们给了我这封信 现在还你\N{\rENG}they gave that to me... To you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.88,0:52:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\rENG}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.20,0:52:36.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rENG}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.80,0:54:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的\N{\rENG}Don't worry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.08,0:54:01.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那家伙不会再打来了\N{\rENG}That guy won't be calling here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.65,0:54:24.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\rENG}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.75,0:59:25.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定有什么不同之处\N{\rENG}There must be some difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.55,0:59:26.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,一点都没有\N{\rENG}There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.47,0:59:29.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们俩不可能完全一样\N{\rENG}It cannot be exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.90,0:59:33.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,但确实如此\N{\rENG}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.10,0:59:36.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有在他面前脱掉衣服？\N{\rENG}Did you take your clothes off in front of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.50,0:59:37.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.38,0:59:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,那还好\N{\rENG}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.29,0:59:42.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你都没吃几口\N{\rENG}You didn't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.37,0:59:49.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你所需经受住的事 就是和陌生人在旅馆里见面\N{\rENG}The last thing you need is to be meeting strange men in hotel rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.84,0:59:53.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在一个女人身上的麻烦已经够多了 知道不？\N{\rENG}You have enough trouble sticking with one woman, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.88,1:00:01.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,给\N{\rENG}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.67,1:00:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢蓝莓\N{\rENG}I don't like blueberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.23,1:00:06.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你超爱的啊 吃蓝莓对你有好处\N{\rENG}Of course you do, and they're good for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.51,1:00:12.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才所说的那些话我就当作没听过\N{\rENG}I am going to pretend I never heard a word of what you just told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.06,1:00:16.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想要你的建议\N{\rENG}I just wanted your advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.74,1:00:17.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不需要什么建议\N{\rENG}You don't want advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.85,1:00:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想再听到任何关于那个人的事了\N{\rENG}I don't want to hear any more about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.89,1:00:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的儿子\N{\rENG}You are my only son.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.57,1:00:25.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你唯一的母亲\N{\rENG}I am your only mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.85,1:00:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有一份受人尊敬的工作 你有一套漂亮的房子\N{\rENG}You have a respectable job, you have a nice apartment,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.52,1:00:32.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈说句心底话\N{\rENG}and since we're being frank here,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.32,1:00:37.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,别再做那种觊觎当三流演员的白日梦了\N{\rENG}I think you should quit that fantasy of being a third-rate movie actor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.24,1:00:40.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,多吃点 要喝点咖啡吗？\N{\rENG}Eat those. You want some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.97,1:01:10.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有话问你\N{\rENG}I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.73,1:01:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是不是上过我老婆？\N{\rENG}Did you fuck my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.60,1:01:16.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有搞上我老婆？\N{\rENG}Did you fuck my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.09,1:01:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有和我老婆上过床？\N{\rENG}Did you sleep with my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.88,1:01:20.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你搞过我老婆吗？\N{\rENG}You fucked my wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.63,1:01:27.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你搞过我老婆吗？\N{\rENG}Did you fuck my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.50,1:01:37.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 这真他妈的太好了\N{\rENG}That's good. That is fuckin' good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.25,1:01:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先 你要做的事是 你把衣服和车都给我\N{\rENG}This is what's gonna happen. You're giving me your clothes and your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.73,1:01:50.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要带上你女友去浪漫私奔\N{\rENG}I'm gonna take your girlfriend on a little romantic getaway.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.16,1:01:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天我就会带她回家\N{\rENG}Tomorrow, I bring her home.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.76,1:01:57.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我回到来\N{\rENG}And I'm gonna come back here,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.56,1:02:03.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,把所有东西都还给你 然后就从你生命中永远消失\N{\rENG}bring back all your things, and I'm gonna disappear from your life forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.67,1:02:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后 你我各安天命\N{\rENG}And then I'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.42,1:02:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来这干嘛？\N{\rENG}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.57,1:02:24.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这他妈什么鬼地方？你在这住？\N{\rENG}What the fuck is this place, man? You live here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.09,1:02:29.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有话要问你\N{\rENG}I have some questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.13,1:02:30.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,请你离开 否则我报警\N{\rENG}Please go or I'll call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.24,1:02:34.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,去啊 报警啊 你怎么跟他们说？\N{\rENG}Go ahead, call the police. What are you gonna tell 'em?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:38.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你打算跟他们说什么？\N{\rENG}What are you gonna tell 'em, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.23,1:02:47.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要找上我？\N{\rENG}Why'd you come looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.59,1:02:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是…\N{\rENG}I don't know. I don't know. I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.66,1:02:55.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得弄明白\N{\rENG}I needed to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.74,1:02:57.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得弄明白 是的 行啊\N{\rENG}You need to know. Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.02,1:03:02.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,可你打电话过来的时候 你跟我老婆聊天了\N{\rENG}But when you called my house, you talked to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.77,1:03:05.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛跟她聊？\N{\rENG}Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.77,1:03:08.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,她碰巧听的电话\N{\rENG}She happened to pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.01,1:03:10.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 那好 但…\N{\rENG}Okay. Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.16,1:03:19.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗？坦诚对答那种\N{\rENG}Can I ask you something, just man to man?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.27,1:03:23.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.51,1:03:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有和我老婆上过床？\N{\rENG}Did you sleep with my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.51,1:03:32.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\rENG}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.90,1:03:34.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你搞过我老婆吗？\N{\rENG}Did you fuck my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.58,1:03:36.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,看你是疯了\N{\rENG}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.98,1:03:39.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只需要回答我有没有\N{\rENG}Just answer the question, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.90,1:03:42.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶快回答我的问题 然后我就走人\N{\rENG}Just answer my fuckin' question and then I will leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.09,1:03:43.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你神经病啊\N{\rENG}You're fuckin' crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.65,1:03:47.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rENG}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.77,1:03:54.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我他妈的神经病了？我他妈的傻了？\N{\rENG}I'm fuckin' crazy? I'm fuckin' crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.32,1:04:00.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我他妈的抓狂了？\N{\rENG}I'm fuckin' crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.64,1:04:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我他妈的疯魔了？\N{\rENG}I'm fuckin' crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.11,1:04:04.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我老婆也牵涉进来了\N{\rENG}You brought my wife into this, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.95,1:04:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我也要把你女朋友拉进来\N{\rENG}So I'm gonna bring your girlfriend into the picture as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.83,1:04:12.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要远离你的生活？首先 你要做的事是\N{\rENG}You want me out of your life? This is what's gonna happen first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.38,1:04:13.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,把你衣服和车都给我\N{\rENG}You're gonna give me your clothes and your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.02,1:04:15.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要带上你女朋友去浪漫私奔\N{\rENG}I'm gonna take your girlfriend on a little romantic getaway.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.90,1:04:18.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天我就会把她带回家 等我回来之后\N{\rENG}I'm gonna bring her back home tomorrow, and I'm gonna come back here,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.26,1:04:19.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把东西都还给你\N{\rENG}and I'm gonna bring back all your stuff
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.38,1:04:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后我就会离开 从你生命中永远消失\N{\rENG}and I'm going to disappear from your life forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.17,1:04:25.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后 你我各安天命\N{\rENG}Then we will be even.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.55,1:07:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,克莱尔先生 下午好 过得怎样？\N{\rENG}Mr. Claire. Good afternoon. Everything good?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.07,1:07:29.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,还好 我 嗯…\N{\rENG}Yeah, I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.02,1:07:34.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我忘带钥匙了\N{\rENG}Uh, forgot my keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.26,1:07:37.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,克莱尔夫人不在家吗？\N{\rENG}Is Mrs. Claire not home?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.97,1:07:43.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要我帮您开门吗？\N{\rENG}Do you want me to open the door for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.81,1:07:45.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就太好了 谢谢\N{\rENG}That'd be perfect. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.15,1:08:11.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,那晚真是让我回味无穷\N{\rENG}I can't stop thinking about the other night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.62,1:08:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我脑海依然回荡着那事\N{\rENG}Can't get it out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.89,1:08:26.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道不该再提起那事\N{\rENG}I know I shouldn't talk about this,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.89,1:08:30.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是 真的很想再去一次\N{\rENG}but I'd love to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.32,1:08:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rENG}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.00,1:08:37.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说他们换了门锁 又分发了新的钥匙\N{\rENG}I heard they changed the lock and sent out new keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.32,1:08:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\rENG}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.24,1:08:42.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,那新名单上却没我的名字\N{\rENG}I don't think I'm on the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.59,1:08:51.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要再去一次\N{\rENG}I need to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.54,1:09:00.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽量帮你的 我不知道…\N{\rENG}I'll see what I can do. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.57,1:09:04.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道能不能真的帮上忙\N{\rENG}I don't know if that's going to be possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.09,1:09:10.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,有任何消息麻烦通知我\N{\rENG}Call me if you hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:15.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,您请\N{\rENG}After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.92,1:09:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 请进 克莱尔先生\N{\rENG}Okay. Here you go, Mr. Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.24,1:09:54.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rENG}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.87,1:10:06.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好？\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.10,1:13:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安东尼？- 回来啦\N{\rENG}- Anthony? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.02,1:13:39.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你开着灯 吓了我一跳\N{\rENG}The light's on, you freaked me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.25,1:13:43.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rENG}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.05,1:13:46.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在家干嘛？我以为你在你妈妈那\N{\rENG}What're you doing home? I thought you were at your mom's.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.41,1:13:51.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 我不去了 我…\N{\rENG}Oh, I canceled it, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.16,1:13:58.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该打电话给我\N{\rENG}Should've called.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.47,1:14:04.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在泳池里泡得有点久\N{\rENG}I stayed longer at the pool,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.83,1:14:09.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我以为你今晚不回家\N{\rENG}'cause I thought you weren't gonna be home.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.94,1:14:20.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\rENG}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.66,1:14:22.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要点什么吗？\N{\rENG}Do you need anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.45,1:14:27.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\rENG}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.28,1:14:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想睡觉了\N{\rENG}I'm gonna go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.40,1:14:36.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.18,1:15:34.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定真的不需要点什么了吗？\N{\rENG}Are you sure you don't need anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.70,1:15:39.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你…\N{\rENG}'Cause you...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.09,1:15:43.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才进门时 你说你在泳池那…\N{\rENG}When you came in and you said that you went to the pool,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.41,1:15:46.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你可能在那里泡了很久的话…\N{\rENG}I just thought maybe that you've been there for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.81,1:15:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你泡完 又走路回家 或许你得…\N{\rENG}and you had to walk home or whatever and you must be...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.41,1:15:51.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么问题？\N{\rENG}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.76,1:15:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怀胎六月了 我不知道是否…\N{\rENG}You're six months pregnant, so I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.72,1:15:59.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事 我很好\N{\rENG}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.34,1:16:22.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不上床睡觉？\N{\rENG}Why don't you come to bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:29.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rENG}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.67,1:16:46.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不脱衣服睡吗？\N{\rENG}Aren't you gonna take your clothes off?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.03,1:16:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,脱的\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.18,1:19:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天在学校工作还好吧？\N{\rENG}Did you have a good day at school?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.97,1:19:06.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rENG}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.21,1:19:11.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\rENG}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.66,1:19:40.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛？怎么了？哇噢 哇噢\N{\rENG}What? What? What? Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.34,1:19:41.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛丽 玛丽\N{\rENG}Mary. Mary. Mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.21,1:19:48.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\rENG}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.57,1:19:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,戒指 你手指上有戒指印\N{\rENG}The ring. The mark on your finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.40,1:19:54.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\rENG}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.24,1:20:00.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直都有的啊\N{\rENG}I've always had this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.91,1:20:03.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\rENG}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.18,1:20:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁？别碰我 走开点\N{\rENG}Who are you? Don't touch me. Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.42,1:20:15.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？你说什么呢？\N{\rENG}What are you talking about? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.58,1:20:17.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别碰我 - 你在说什么？\N{\rENG}- Don't touch me! - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.98,1:20:20.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,戒指 你手指有戒指印\N{\rENG}The ring. The mark on your finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.92,1:21:20.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rENG}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.07,1:21:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,又怎样了？\N{\rENG}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.27,1:21:31.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\rENG}I just couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.86,1:21:36.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也睡不着\N{\rENG}Yeah, I couldn't sleep either.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.85,1:21:44.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rENG}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.45,1:21:51.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么这样对我？\N{\rENG}Why are you doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.04,1:21:54.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？我对你做了什么了？\N{\rENG}What? What am I doing to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.11,1:22:02.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你留下来\N{\rENG}I want you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.95,1:22:06.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 停车？你说停车？\N{\rENG}- Stop the car. - Stop the car? Stop the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.75,1:22:08.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 停车啊 - 我他妈的会停车的\N{\rENG}- Stop the fucking car. - I'll stop the fucking car.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.75,1:22:09.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要我停车？\N{\rENG}You want me to stop the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.43,1:22:11.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,滚出去 我受够了\N{\rENG}Get out. I'm sick of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.14,1:22:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想再和你说话了\N{\rENG}I can't even talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.54,1:22:15.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\rENG}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.70,1:22:17.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的行为很幼稚\N{\rENG}You're behaving like a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.74,1:22:19.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是男人\N{\rENG}You're not a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.26,1:22:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不是男人？- 够了 你不需要和我解释\N{\rENG}- I'm not a man? - Enough. You don't need to get me started.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.25,1:22:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是男人？\N{\rENG}I'm not a man?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.21,1:22:25.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他妈的 我不是男人？滚出去\N{\rENG}I'm not a fucking man? Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.33,1:22:28.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的滚出去 - 一起啊\N{\rENG}- Get out! Get the fuck out! - Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.92,1:23:15.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,白天阳光灿烂 最高温度24度\N{\rENG}Sunshine, a high of 24 today,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.12,1:23:17.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,夜晚天空晴朗 最低温度13度\N{\rENG}clear tonight with a low of 13.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.08,1:23:19.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,主持人詹姆斯为您报道事故现场\N{\rENG}Here's James with a look at traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.88,1:23:22.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴瑟斯特路与斯特罗德路间的莱克肖路西行车道实施封路\N{\rENG}The westbound Lake Shore is closed between Bathurst and Strachan,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.75,1:23:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,工作人员正在清理今天凌晨发生的一起事故的残骸\N{\rENG}as crews clean up debris from a collision that happened early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.31,1:23:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,警方目前仍未透露任何细节\N{\rENG}Police have not released any details at this time,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.19,1:23:29.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得到的消息是事故现场只有一辆车\N{\rENG}but we do know there was only one vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.11,1:25:24.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,忘了和你说 你妈妈打过电话来\N{\rENG}I forgot to tell you that your mother called.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.79,1:25:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好给她回个电话\N{\rENG}You should probably call her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.07,1:25:28.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.60,1:25:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦 今晚你有安排什么活动吗？\N{\rENG}Helen, did you plan on doing something tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.04,1:26:02.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我要外出\N{\rENG}'Cause I think I have to go out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.39,1:26:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦？\N{\rENG}Helen?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.18,1:26:18.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,海伦？\N{\rENG}Helen?
